# Cloudflare
.wrangler/
.dev.vars

# Local env. Every .env file is ignored, including .env.production: the value
# that reaches a deploy comes from the Cloudflare build variables, not from a
# file, so a committed file could only ever disagree with it. The .example
# files are the tracked record of what each one has to contain.
.env
.env.*
!.env.*.example
